# CPanel supervisor home

Authority: `docs/platforms/cpanel/supervisor-home.md`. Workflow: `.cursor/skills/cpanel-supervisor-home/SKILL.md`. Backend: `docs/platforms/backend/contracts/supervisor-catalog-and-home.md`.

## Payload

- `Query.home` is Me-shaped (`HomeBridge`: `STATIC` + `where: { id: supervisor.id }`). Payload is **extras only**.
- Do not add `static relations` to meetings or invent a Supervisor↔Meeting association.
- Meeting cards: root `meetings(filter:)` with GraphQL aliases. Cap in the client (currently 5).
- Counts on home: prefixed extras on `_Home`. Directory headers keep `*Stats` roots. Do not bind home tiles to `customerStats`.

## Chart series

- Subscription bars: calendar months **1–12 of the year of** `Subscription.THIS_MONTH_START()`, `created_at` buckets, zeros filled. Not status bars. Not a rolling 12 months ending at now.
- X-axis: month **numbers**. Arabic month name belongs in the custom tooltip.
- Fills: brand tokens (`primaryActionBackground`, `accentActionBackground`, `iconPrimary`, `textAccent`, `textBrand`). Not `stateSuccess` / `stateError` / `stateWarning`.
- Tooltip: Utils + `semanticColor` content. Never the default Recharts tooltip.

## Copy and chrome

- Hero title: متابعة المنصة. Lead must exist: نظرة على أداء وإحصائيات المنصة.
- Stats eyebrow: الإحصاءات. Do not use إشراف or الحصر.
- Hero height follows content. Small decorative corners. No Masdaria gradients, fake sparklines, or نبض.

## Adapter

- Mount-private identify. Inherit `DATA_ADAPTERS.SUPERVISOR_GQL`. No new registry key. No `listable`.
